    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm looking at a house contract in seattle and it keeps mentioning \"escrow\" and an \"escrow agent.\" i'm a bit lost lol. what does that actually mean and why do they need to hold my money like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
